@startuml US08_modification_employe
scale 2
title US08 — Modification du Dossier Employé

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam LifelineStrategy solid

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor              #3F51B5
    ActorBorderColor        #3F51B5
    ActorBackgroundColor    #E8EAF6
    ParticipantBorderColor  #3F51B5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8EAF6
    LifeLineBorderColor     #BDBDBD
    NoteBackgroundColor     #FFFDE7
    NoteBorderColor         #FBC02D
    GroupBackgroundColor    #EDE7F6
    GroupBorderColor        #7E57C2
    GroupHeaderFontColor    #4527A0
}

actor       "Administrateur RH"  as RH
participant "Angular UI"         as Angular
participant "Gateway (:8080)"    as Gateway
participant "EmployeeController" as Ctrl
participant "EmployeeService"    as Svc
participant "EmployeeRepository" as Repo
database    "MySQL"              as DB

ref over RH, Angular, Gateway
    Authentification préalable — JWT obtenu via Auth-Service
end ref

|||

RH      ->  Angular  : 1. Modifier les informations & valider

Angular ->  Gateway  : 2. PUT /api/employees/{id}
note right of Angular : Body: EmployeeRequest\nHeader: Authorization: Bearer JWT

Gateway ->  Gateway  : 3. Valider JWT + vérifier rôle
note right of Gateway
  Rôle requis : HR_ADMIN ou MANAGER
  → 403 Forbidden si insuffisant
end note

Gateway ->  Ctrl     : 4. PUT /api/employees/{id}
note right of Ctrl
  @PreAuthorize(
    "hasAuthority('HR_ADMIN')
     or hasAuthority('MANAGER')")
end note

Ctrl    ->  Svc      : 5. update(id, EmployeeRequest)
Svc     ->  Repo     : 6. findById(id)
Repo    --> Svc      : 7. Employee entité existante

Svc     ->  Svc      : 8. fromRequest(emp, req)
note right of Svc : Mise à jour des champs modifiés

Svc     ->  Repo     : 9. save(Employee)
Repo    ->  DB       : 10. UPDATE employee SET ... WHERE id = ?
DB      --> Repo     : 11. Confirmation SQL
Repo    --> Svc      : 12. Employee sauvegardé

Svc     ->  Svc      : 13. toDto(Employee)
Svc     --> Ctrl     : 14. EmployeeDTO mis à jour
Ctrl    --> Gateway  : 15. 200 OK
Gateway --> Angular  : 15. 200 OK
Angular --> RH       : 16. "Dossier mis à jour avec succès"

@enduml
